.TH XPN 1 "October 2026" "XPN 0.1.0"
.SH NAME
xpn \- enroll and connect to an XPN TLS/WebSocket VPN
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B xpn enroll
.I profile.json
.RB [ --scan ]
.br
.B sudo xpn connect
.I profile.json
.RB [ --inner-encryption " on|off" ]
.RB [ --require-pq ]
.RB [ --single-stream ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Enroll using a one-use invitation entered at the prompt or scanned with a camera.
The profile is private device credentials; do not share it with another client.
Connect requires root to configure TUN, routes and the firewall.
Full or split routing is taken from the server-authorized profile.
The client itself retries connection failures indefinitely with randomized
exponential backoff, both interactively and under systemd. Delays are 5-10,
10-20, 20-40, 40-80, 80-160, then 150-300 seconds, in addition to attempt time.
Two minutes connected resets the backoff. Initial startup is delayed 0-5 seconds.
Ctrl-C or SIGTERM stops retries and restores network state. Ordinary networking
resumes between attempts; this is not a persistent kill switch.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --no-retry
Make a single connection attempt, exiting on failure or disconnect.
.TP
.B --retry-initial SECONDS
Initial retry ceiling; default 10. Wait half to all of the ceiling.
.TP
.B --retry-max SECONDS
Maximum retry ceiling; default 300. Allowed up to 3600.
.TP
.B --stable-seconds SECONDS
Connected uptime required to reset backoff; default 120.
.TP
.B --scan
Read the enrollment QR code with zbarcam (zbar-tools).
.TP
.B --inner-encryption on|off
Enable or disable the additional ChaCha20-Poly1305 layer. Outer TLS remains on.
.TP
.B --require-pq
Require hybrid ML-KEM key exchange; fail if unsupported.
.TP
.B --single-stream
Disable the default authenticated standby lane for older servers.
.TP
.B --native PATH
Select the native executable. Normally use the packaged executable.
.TP
.B --invitation URL
Supply the invitation as an argument. Prefer the prompt to avoid shell history.
.SH FILES
.I /usr/lib/xpn/client/xpnd
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR xpn-client-setup (8),
.BR xpn-server-setup (8)
